title: Moderation desk
description: For district moderators only.
permalink: /desk/
noindex: true
sitemap: false
bodyClass: desk-page
scripts: ["desk.js"]
styles: ["desk.css"]
---
{#- The moderation desk. Everything on it comes from the Sheet script after the moderator signs in; this page
    itself holds no data. The script's web address arrives after the # in the links that moderators are emailed,
    and is remembered on the phone. -#}
<div class="wrap section narrow desk" data-desk>
  <div class="desk-head">
    <h1 data-t="title">Moderation desk</h1>
    <div class="desk-tools">
      <a class="btn-small" href="/desk/guide/" data-t="guide">Guide</a>
      <button type="button" class="btn-small" data-lang>हिन्दी</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-small" data-signout hidden data-t="signOut">Sign out</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted" data-me hidden></p>
  <div class="desk-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-msg hidden></div>
  <div data-out><p class="muted">Loading…</p></div>
  <noscript><p class="callout">The moderation desk needs JavaScript. Please open it in Chrome or Safari.</p></noscript>
</div>
